# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
$ABI strict
$Module cookie_handoff 3 "Request-owned response cookie handoff"
$Event delivery_event

$Function VOID reset(PRIV_TASK)
$Restrict vcl_recv

Discard request state before a new receive attempt, including restart to a HIT.

$Function STRING open(PRIV_TASK)
$Restrict vcl_miss

Allocate a handoff owned by this client task, including task-finalization cleanup.

$Function VOID bind(PRIV_TASK, STRING key)
$Restrict vcl_backend_fetch

Bind the backend task before removing the internal key from the origin request.

$Function VOID discard(PRIV_TASK)
$Restrict vcl_backend_error

Discard fields belonging to an abandoned backend response.

$Function BOOL detach(PRIV_TASK, STRING rules, BOOL background = 0)
$Restrict vcl_backend_response

Detach complete Set-Cookie fields only when every name has the Shared action.
Rules are ordered action TAB kind TAB literal-name LF, generated by the same
resolver used for request cookies. Personal values never enter the cache object.

$Function VOID deliver(PRIV_TASK)
$Restrict vcl_deliver

Append the original fields to their owning client response only.

$Function INT pending()

Number of live handoffs, for lifecycle verification (never cookie contents).

$Function INT delivery_recv(PRIV_TOP)
$Restrict vcl_recv

UltraCache only: 1 prepare PASS, 2 prepared fragment synth, -1 abort, 0 ordinary.
The phase is request-owned, never inferred from client headers.

$Function BOOL delivery_guard(PRIV_TOP)
$Restrict vcl_recv vcl_pass vcl_miss

Reject a post-prepare parent refetch instead of executing its provider twice.

$Function BOOL delivery_resume_authorized(PRIV_TOP, STRING site)
$Restrict vcl_recv

Read-only ingress proof for the same initially authorized top-level GET.
Requires exact native phase/restart plus stored adapter site, host and URI.
No request header, positive restart count alone or other task creates a grant.

$Function BOOL delivery_recover(PRIV_TOP)
$Restrict vcl_miss

Use one authenticated public-publication-only recovery fetch after an owned
prepare whose response explicitly confirmed that application capability.

$Function BOOL delivery_backend(PRIV_TASK)
$Restrict vcl_backend_fetch

Bind the single owned prepare request and set its origin wire from native state.

$Function BOOL delivery_capture(PRIV_TASK)
$Restrict vcl_backend_response

Capture authentic repeated Set-Cookie and attach the body fetch filter.
The caller must use uc_delivery_capture with do_stream=false and private PASS.

$Function BACKEND delivery_local_backend(PRIV_TASK, PRIV_VCL)
$Restrict vcl_backend_fetch

Select the native source only for an owned, prepared request snapshot recovery.
Returns no backend for ordinary requests, Basic or application snapshot fallback.

$Function BOOL delivery_local_source(PRIV_TASK)
$Restrict vcl_backend_response

Select the request snapshot source filter before the ordinary native ESI parser.

$Function BACKEND delivery_private_backend(PRIV_TASK, PRIV_VCL)
$Restrict vcl_backend_fetch

Select a scoped fragment source only from the authenticated prepared claim.

$Function BOOL delivery_private_source()
$Restrict vcl_backend_response

Identify a backend task which owns the prepared private fragment source.

$Function INT delivery_private_remaining()
$Restrict vcl_deliver

Whole remaining seconds for an authenticated read-only private cache lookup.

$Function BOOL delivery_recovery_response(PRIV_TASK)
$Restrict vcl_backend_response

Validate the bound snapshot-only response before stripping its ephemeral proof.

$Function INT delivery_deliver(PRIV_TOP, STRING target, INT occurrences, BOOL begin = 0)
$Restrict vcl_deliver

UltraCache only: begin an eligible parent HIT prepare, or validate/restore its
captured response. 1 means restart before headers, -1 means abort. A completed
whole-document alternative returns 2 for immediate owned private synthesis.
A fragment continuation appends authentic provider fields and returns 0 for final delivery.
Only begin=true may start a new continuation; resumed deliveries still receive
the actual parent metadata even when the parent was fetched after eviction.

$Function BOOL delivery_synth(PRIV_TOP)
$Restrict vcl_synth

Replay an owned complete private document or pre-rendered private child.

$Function STRING selection_epoch()

Native build identity; no visitor data. Namespaces only new UltraCache replicas.

$Function BOOL selection_register(STRING site, STRING host, STRING scope, STRING wordpress_policy, STRING names, BOOL enabled)
$Restrict vcl_recv

Called only after existing per-site HTTP capabilities authentication. Stores
the required frontend scope, exact resolver names and WP identity, never values.
An empty names list is an application boundary without an active resolver.
Enabled false removes only that exact scope. Ordinary probes do not call it.

$Function STRING selection_names(STRING site, STRING host, STRING scope)
$Restrict vcl_recv vcl_synth

Return registered metadata only for this adapter site, host and exact scope.

$Function STRING selection_wordpress_policy(STRING site, STRING host, STRING scope)
$Restrict vcl_recv vcl_synth

Return the independent accepted WP policy identity.

$Function STRING selection_actions(STRING rules, STRING names)
$Restrict vcl_recv vcl_synth

Project exact names through the active generated ordered matcher. Existing
unmatched-name behavior is Shared; no additional cookie decision list.

$Function INT selection_begin(PRIV_TOP, STRING site, STRING policy, STRING rules)
$Restrict vcl_recv

After normal route/auth/cookie decisions: 1 owned original-route preparation,
0 no negotiated active Variant resolver, -1 allocation/binding error.

$Function STRING selection_manifest(PRIV_TOP)
$Restrict vcl_recv vcl_hash vcl_hit vcl_deliver

Only an owned prepared selection exposes its exact signed target publication.

$Function STRING selection_variant(PRIV_TOP)
$Restrict vcl_recv

Native Variant projection of the logical candidate; actual Cookie stays intact.

$Function BOOL selection_local(PRIV_TASK)
$Restrict vcl_backend_response

True only for the new authenticated selected-publication source. Old recovery
keeps its own cookie variation and source-manifest binding unchanged.

$Function BOOL selection_raw(PRIV_TASK)
$Restrict vcl_backend_response

True only for an owned public-select fetch returning a genuine non-protocol
response. Deliver that private PASS normally, without capturing its body.
